    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b523416e4d174bb2b85e6248",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮虽然跑赢了成田白仁，\n却发现她眼里看着的\n是比赛结果以外的“某个东西”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81e62036d9aebf6183c0ae58f23ab5a0e224cf62a086321df31997f91b25a7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024423.json",
      "json_path": [
