    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9517ab0be76da66aad7fe70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "输给了成田白仁的摩耶重炮\n发现她眼里看着的是\n比赛结果以外的“某个东西”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b0ed316c46456d0e4b52929266de0c7bc7f6a70fd797ae2b8440467627101e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
