    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7d1d3c77f9230a443fae898",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，摩耶重炮听菱亚马逊说，\n成田白仁打算在“有马纪念”\n结束后引退──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec08f8c826ca102f2b026283558ffba1de325bef10dee2ee2fedb3410b0d6bee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
