    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9179f88fa29dc9c8543712a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮发誓要成长为能让她感到兴奋的赛马娘。\n为此，要挑战强敌云集的\nGⅠ比赛“宝冢纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a60636cc59143eb2fd3346c7cfadd3df81704c9ede61781701ac4daea775fe8",
