    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93fc860d7b248b9027243dc1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮在“宝冢纪念”的赛场上全速奔驰，\n并取得了好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28eaf70082b3e9cfda37e644997b50313d5a0e9d9d57b1f544337e434ccade28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62b6fb510fec304f4190d8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她接下来的目标是“天皇赏（秋）”！\n她充满了干劲，\n表示要使尽全力奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed28c35ba638239279f581245221b8c82e8d84953167641687a297e2ced6269",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f6156d1ad1e0a1cced1eea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，\n目睹摩耶重炮奔跑速度的成田白仁──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f65888e06e37497635f68ce666873cf209aa56095d193d0b5f344985af21869c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea535cff7a3d1ad27cdc1308",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心中燃起了熊熊烈火，\n离开了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c463f9759f74ad1bea721cdb825a96f677009578a1c46748dd6367bed5d203f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b8d1c089ce8c3aca970a22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・前往驾驶舱",
      "source_fingerprint": "622f9d1046831d36b22f8cbccf836c50da247c1f8f830320b9efc19280d06899",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed340fda7660691c8b9238b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮称霸了“天皇赏（秋）”，\n真的成长成能让粉丝\n兴奋不已的赛马娘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7d2893c164bc1aabf0eee6e8fd48fab94970a6a7932984af64ef431a0deb0ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c13d243129d47f5d4326a0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天之后……当摩耶重炮训练到一半时，\n看见了成田白仁\n在和鲁道夫象征并跑练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d58ff4daed8aae341430e6648892b36b813ca5eb6cdcfc46de0a506be77046e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d3ea410173a15e978ef8404",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮看见变得更加耀眼的成田白仁后，\n下定决心要全力以赴，\n参加“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe019959752f8806d597ceadee3f56eec556726bd2971b90986579a4f9b6d32f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024426.json",
      "json_path": [
