      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮听见了最想听到的话之后，\n因为太过高兴而哇哇大哭起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aefc7267f2645b7478913fce2b04e864fef9d923cdab9709c4d3f59b58a5b95f",
