      "uid": "zhcn:bf1b6b57eb6054ba3e52c651",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮的表现已经成长到，\n足以说服成田白仁不要引退那般\n灿烂夺目的程度了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae9e65fac188c39ad2a46b30b40a8ffedfe28abdeddf2443b38ae399d0b8c0a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
